[
  {
    "start": "00:00:04.668",
    "end": "00:00:06.437",
    "start_seconds": 4.668,
    "end_seconds": 6.437,
    "text": "Idiots --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:06.470",
    "end": "00:00:08.839",
    "start_seconds": 6.47,
    "end_seconds": 8.839,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:08.839",
    "end": "00:00:10.174",
    "start_seconds": 8.839,
    "end_seconds": 10.174,
    "text": "Are everywhere."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:10.207",
    "end": "00:00:12.209",
    "start_seconds": 10.207,
    "end_seconds": 12.209,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:12.243",
    "end": "00:00:16.614",
    "start_seconds": 12.243,
    "end_seconds": 16.614,
    "text": "Some people drive you right up the wall with their opinions, their attitudes,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:16.614",
    "end": "00:00:17.948",
    "start_seconds": 16.614,
    "end_seconds": 17.948,
    "text": "their politics."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:17.982",
    "end": "00:00:20.785",
    "start_seconds": 17.982,
    "end_seconds": 20.785,
    "text": "I dealt with all kinds of people in my 20-plus years"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:20.785",
    "end": "00:00:22.553",
    "start_seconds": 20.785,
    "end_seconds": 22.553,
    "text": "as a broadcast journalist."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:22.586",
    "end": "00:00:25.156",
    "start_seconds": 22.586,
    "end_seconds": 25.156,
    "text": "Eventually, I found moderating tough conversations"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:25.189",
    "end": "00:00:28.426",
    "start_seconds": 25.189,
    "end_seconds": 28.426,
    "text": "with whatever kind of difficult people you just thought of."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:28.459",
    "end": "00:00:30.294",
    "start_seconds": 28.459,
    "end_seconds": 30.294,
    "text": "Kind of simple to do --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:30.294",
    "end": "00:00:32.063",
    "start_seconds": 30.294,
    "end_seconds": 32.063,
    "text": "not easy -- but simple."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:32.496",
    "end": "00:00:36.000",
    "start_seconds": 32.496,
    "end_seconds": 36.0,
    "text": "The trick is to go somewhere I know you'd rather not be."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:36.667",
    "end": "00:00:38.069",
    "start_seconds": 36.667,
    "end_seconds": 38.069,
    "text": "Closer."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:38.102",
    "end": "00:00:40.604",
    "start_seconds": 38.102,
    "end_seconds": 40.604,
    "text": "Distance makes things worse."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:41.272",
    "end": "00:00:42.540",
    "start_seconds": 41.272,
    "end_seconds": 42.54,
    "text": "I came up in public radio,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:42.573",
    "end": "00:00:46.644",
    "start_seconds": 42.573,
    "end_seconds": 46.644,
    "text": "trained by old-school journalists who taught me the art of neutrality."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:46.677",
    "end": "00:00:49.180",
    "start_seconds": 46.677,
    "end_seconds": 49.18,
    "text": "You neutralize your opinions, deaden your emotions,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:49.213",
    "end": "00:00:52.817",
    "start_seconds": 49.213,
    "end_seconds": 52.817,
    "text": "and you can get through most conversations without rolling your eyes."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:52.850",
    "end": "00:00:56.387",
    "start_seconds": 52.85,
    "end_seconds": 56.387,
    "text": "Generally, it worked, and it built me a strong reputation for fairness."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:56.420",
    "end": "00:01:01.892",
    "start_seconds": 56.42,
    "end_seconds": 61.892,
    "text": "But when the subject matter felt personal, neutrality felt phony."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:02.426",
    "end": "00:01:05.696",
    "start_seconds": 62.426,
    "end_seconds": 65.696,
    "text": "I used to host a national talk show on NPR called \"1A,\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:05.696",
    "end": "00:01:07.298",
    "start_seconds": 65.696,
    "end_seconds": 67.298,
    "text": "and in one of our early programs,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:07.331",
    "end": "00:01:10.668",
    "start_seconds": 67.331,
    "end_seconds": 70.668,
    "text": "I interviewed a descendant of Confederate soldiers."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:10.668",
    "end": "00:01:14.638",
    "start_seconds": 70.668,
    "end_seconds": 74.638,
    "text": "He argued that Confederate monuments should be historically preserved."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:14.638",
    "end": "00:01:18.075",
    "start_seconds": 74.638,
    "end_seconds": 78.075,
    "text": "Now as a Black man, I felt enormous pressure to remain neutral,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:18.109",
    "end": "00:01:22.079",
    "start_seconds": 78.10900000000001,
    "end_seconds": 82.07900000000001,
    "text": "so I decided I was just going to focus on his arguments instead of on him."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:22.113",
    "end": "00:01:25.049",
    "start_seconds": 82.113,
    "end_seconds": 85.049,
    "text": "His logic felt kind of flimsy, and I called him on it,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:25.082",
    "end": "00:01:27.718",
    "start_seconds": 85.082,
    "end_seconds": 87.718,
    "text": "and eventually he just folded and he said,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:27.751",
    "end": "00:01:30.087",
    "start_seconds": 87.751,
    "end_seconds": 90.087,
    "text": "“It really doesn’t matter what I say.”"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:30.121",
    "end": "00:01:34.158",
    "start_seconds": 90.121,
    "end_seconds": 94.158,
    "text": "And the moment he said that, I knew I had failed."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:34.925",
    "end": "00:01:36.127",
    "start_seconds": 94.925,
    "end_seconds": 96.12700000000001,
    "text": "I may have had a point,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:36.160",
    "end": "00:01:38.996",
    "start_seconds": 96.16,
    "end_seconds": 98.99600000000001,
    "text": "but I missed a huge opportunity to really do my job."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:39.363",
    "end": "00:01:42.833",
    "start_seconds": 99.363,
    "end_seconds": 102.833,
    "text": "See, my neutrality allowed me to interrogate his beliefs,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:42.867",
    "end": "00:01:48.339",
    "start_seconds": 102.86699999999999,
    "end_seconds": 108.339,
    "text": "but the distance prevented me from seeing why he believed them."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:49.140",
    "end": "00:01:52.109",
    "start_seconds": 109.14,
    "end_seconds": 112.10900000000001,
    "text": "What if I had asked better questions like:"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:52.143",
    "end": "00:01:55.746",
    "start_seconds": 112.143,
    "end_seconds": 115.74600000000001,
    "text": "\"Who influenced you the most in forming these views?\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:56.280",
    "end": "00:02:01.585",
    "start_seconds": 116.28,
    "end_seconds": 121.585,
    "text": "Or, \"Suppose we let all of these monuments and statues stand just as they are."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:01.619",
    "end": "00:02:03.454",
    "start_seconds": 121.619,
    "end_seconds": 123.454,
    "text": "What would that mean to you?\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:03.487",
    "end": "00:02:05.723",
    "start_seconds": 123.487,
    "end_seconds": 125.723,
    "text": "Getting his story might have shown me him"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:05.723",
    "end": "00:02:07.758",
    "start_seconds": 125.723,
    "end_seconds": 127.758,
    "text": "behind his canned arguments."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:07.791",
    "end": "00:02:10.494",
    "start_seconds": 127.791,
    "end_seconds": 130.494,
    "text": "Grilling him changed nothing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:10.528",
    "end": "00:02:12.129",
    "start_seconds": 130.528,
    "end_seconds": 132.129,
    "text": "It felt pointless."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:12.496",
    "end": "00:02:14.331",
    "start_seconds": 132.496,
    "end_seconds": 134.331,
    "text": "When you consider someone problematic,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:14.331",
    "end": "00:02:16.267",
    "start_seconds": 134.331,
    "end_seconds": 136.267,
    "text": "there's a better way to deal with them,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:16.300",
    "end": "00:02:19.503",
    "start_seconds": 136.3,
    "end_seconds": 139.503,
    "text": "keep your sanity and maybe even connect."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:19.537",
    "end": "00:02:21.238",
    "start_seconds": 139.537,
    "end_seconds": 141.238,
    "text": "And it sounds insane."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:21.972",
    "end": "00:02:24.175",
    "start_seconds": 141.972,
    "end_seconds": 144.175,
    "text": "Move closer."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:24.175",
    "end": "00:02:26.844",
    "start_seconds": 144.175,
    "end_seconds": 146.844,
    "text": "Not to embrace them, but to explore them,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:26.844",
    "end": "00:02:29.046",
    "start_seconds": 146.844,
    "end_seconds": 149.046,
    "text": "like a doctor studying a sample."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:29.079",
    "end": "00:02:31.482",
    "start_seconds": 149.079,
    "end_seconds": 151.482,
    "text": "You need a microscope, not a telescope."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:31.949",
    "end": "00:02:35.553",
    "start_seconds": 151.949,
    "end_seconds": 155.553,
    "text": "Doctors actually helped me learn this way before I became a journalist."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:35.586",
    "end": "00:02:39.823",
    "start_seconds": 155.586,
    "end_seconds": 159.823,
    "text": "As a teenager, I was part of a summer program for future doctors."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:39.857",
    "end": "00:02:41.392",
    "start_seconds": 159.857,
    "end_seconds": 161.392,
    "text": "Clearly it worked."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:41.392",
    "end": "00:02:45.196",
    "start_seconds": 161.392,
    "end_seconds": 165.196,
    "text": "And I found myself working with clinicians studying cancer"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:45.229",
    "end": "00:02:47.031",
    "start_seconds": 165.22899999999998,
    "end_seconds": 167.031,
    "text": "and thrombosis and HIV,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:47.064",
    "end": "00:02:48.432",
    "start_seconds": 167.064,
    "end_seconds": 168.43200000000002,
    "text": "very serious conditions."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:48.766",
    "end": "00:02:52.236",
    "start_seconds": 168.766,
    "end_seconds": 172.236,
    "text": "I kind of naively expected them to be these crusading scientists,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:52.269",
    "end": "00:02:54.939",
    "start_seconds": 172.269,
    "end_seconds": 174.939,
    "text": "but they were just level-headed people doing their jobs."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:55.372",
    "end": "00:02:58.008",
    "start_seconds": 175.372,
    "end_seconds": 178.008,
    "text": "But there was a lesson in that level-headedness."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:58.042",
    "end": "00:03:01.812",
    "start_seconds": 178.042,
    "end_seconds": 181.812,
    "text": "See, I am not neutral about the cancers in our world:"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:01.845",
    "end": "00:03:04.915",
    "start_seconds": 181.845,
    "end_seconds": 184.915,
    "text": "bigotry, hoaxes, political violence."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:04.949",
    "end": "00:03:06.350",
    "start_seconds": 184.949,
    "end_seconds": 186.35,
    "text": "I want them gone."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:06.383",
    "end": "00:03:08.219",
    "start_seconds": 186.383,
    "end_seconds": 188.219,
    "text": "However, as a journalist,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:08.252",
    "end": "00:03:10.888",
    "start_seconds": 188.252,
    "end_seconds": 190.888,
    "text": "I often had to deal with them in my clinic:"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:10.921",
    "end": "00:03:12.189",
    "start_seconds": 190.921,
    "end_seconds": 192.189,
    "text": "“on-the-air.”"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:12.223",
    "end": "00:03:15.893",
    "start_seconds": 192.223,
    "end_seconds": 195.893,
    "text": "I survived it by getting as close to those problems as I could"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:15.926",
    "end": "00:03:18.862",
    "start_seconds": 195.926,
    "end_seconds": 198.862,
    "text": "and studying them like samples in a petri dish."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:18.896",
    "end": "00:03:20.164",
    "start_seconds": 198.89600000000002,
    "end_seconds": 200.164,
    "text": "In other words,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:20.197",
    "end": "00:03:23.500",
    "start_seconds": 200.197,
    "end_seconds": 203.5,
    "text": "I had to shift from neutrality"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:23.500",
    "end": "00:03:25.536",
    "start_seconds": 203.5,
    "end_seconds": 205.536,
    "text": "to objectivity."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:25.569",
    "end": "00:03:27.571",
    "start_seconds": 205.569,
    "end_seconds": 207.571,
    "text": "And no, they're not the same."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:28.272",
    "end": "00:03:32.676",
    "start_seconds": 208.272,
    "end_seconds": 212.676,
    "text": "Objectivity is just when you park your emotions and learn without judgment."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:32.710",
    "end": "00:03:33.978",
    "start_seconds": 212.71,
    "end_seconds": 213.978,
    "text": "I don't have to like it,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:34.011",
    "end": "00:03:35.779",
    "start_seconds": 214.011,
    "end_seconds": 215.779,
    "text": "I'm just here to learn from it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:35.779",
    "end": "00:03:39.783",
    "start_seconds": 215.779,
    "end_seconds": 219.78300000000002,
    "text": "Neutrality negates your opinions as if you have no judgments."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:39.817",
    "end": "00:03:43.520",
    "start_seconds": 219.817,
    "end_seconds": 223.52,
    "text": "Does anyone here honestly believe I have no opinions on race?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:43.520",
    "end": "00:03:44.688",
    "start_seconds": 223.52,
    "end_seconds": 224.688,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:44.722",
    "end": "00:03:45.856",
    "start_seconds": 224.722,
    "end_seconds": 225.856,
    "text": "Right?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:45.889",
    "end": "00:03:48.559",
    "start_seconds": 225.889,
    "end_seconds": 228.559,
    "text": "Now notice I said park your opinions."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:48.559",
    "end": "00:03:50.394",
    "start_seconds": 228.559,
    "end_seconds": 230.394,
    "text": "When you park your car,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:50.394",
    "end": "00:03:52.129",
    "start_seconds": 230.394,
    "end_seconds": 232.129,
    "text": "you don't abandon it in the garage."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:52.129",
    "end": "00:03:53.497",
    "start_seconds": 232.129,
    "end_seconds": 233.497,
    "text": "You're coming back for it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:53.530",
    "end": "00:03:56.834",
    "start_seconds": 233.53,
    "end_seconds": 236.834,
    "text": "So you can choose when to focus inward on what you think,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:56.867",
    "end": "00:03:58.636",
    "start_seconds": 236.867,
    "end_seconds": 238.636,
    "text": "or outward on what you can learn."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:59.203",
    "end": "00:04:02.573",
    "start_seconds": 239.203,
    "end_seconds": 242.573,
    "text": "Of course, sometimes your car ain't where you left it,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:02.606",
    "end": "00:04:05.175",
    "start_seconds": 242.606,
    "end_seconds": 245.175,
    "text": "and maybe your opinions will move too."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:05.175",
    "end": "00:04:08.112",
    "start_seconds": 245.175,
    "end_seconds": 248.112,
    "text": "That maybe is why objectivity feels so vulnerable."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:08.612",
    "end": "00:04:10.414",
    "start_seconds": 248.612,
    "end_seconds": 250.414,
    "text": "That's why it works."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:10.447",
    "end": "00:04:13.284",
    "start_seconds": 250.447,
    "end_seconds": 253.284,
    "text": "That vulnerability is a sign of openness,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:13.284",
    "end": "00:04:17.154",
    "start_seconds": 253.284,
    "end_seconds": 257.154,
    "text": "and a conversation that's not open is pointless."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:17.154",
    "end": "00:04:21.525",
    "start_seconds": 257.154,
    "end_seconds": 261.525,
    "text": "But if you can stay open, amazing things can happen."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:21.558",
    "end": "00:04:25.829",
    "start_seconds": 261.558,
    "end_seconds": 265.829,
    "text": "Another time on NPR, I was interviewing a former Baltimore police officer"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:25.863",
    "end": "00:04:29.300",
    "start_seconds": 265.863,
    "end_seconds": 269.3,
    "text": "who had become this fiery advocate for law enforcement reform."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:29.333",
    "end": "00:04:31.201",
    "start_seconds": 269.33299999999997,
    "end_seconds": 271.201,
    "text": "And he was going on and on,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:31.201",
    "end": "00:04:33.237",
    "start_seconds": 271.201,
    "end_seconds": 273.237,
    "text": "just a long rant in autopilot,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:33.237",
    "end": "00:04:35.472",
    "start_seconds": 273.237,
    "end_seconds": 275.472,
    "text": "just (vocalizing)."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:35.472",
    "end": "00:04:38.542",
    "start_seconds": 275.472,
    "end_seconds": 278.54200000000003,
    "text": "And I was trying to stay objective and listening as best I could,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:38.575",
    "end": "00:04:42.546",
    "start_seconds": 278.575,
    "end_seconds": 282.546,
    "text": "when I thought I heard his voice waver just a little."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:42.980",
    "end": "00:04:44.348",
    "start_seconds": 282.98,
    "end_seconds": 284.348,
    "text": "And in that waver,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:44.381",
    "end": "00:04:46.583",
    "start_seconds": 284.381,
    "end_seconds": 286.58299999999997,
    "text": "I detected more than his rage."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:47.084",
    "end": "00:04:48.686",
    "start_seconds": 287.084,
    "end_seconds": 288.686,
    "text": "It sounded like trauma."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:49.586",
    "end": "00:04:51.188",
    "start_seconds": 289.586,
    "end_seconds": 291.188,
    "text": "So near the end of the interview,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:51.188",
    "end": "00:04:52.656",
    "start_seconds": 291.188,
    "end_seconds": 292.656,
    "text": "I mentioned, hesitantly,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:52.690",
    "end": "00:04:57.061",
    "start_seconds": 292.69,
    "end_seconds": 297.061,
    "text": "that he seemed traumatized by his experiences as a cop,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:57.094",
    "end": "00:04:58.696",
    "start_seconds": 297.094,
    "end_seconds": 298.696,
    "text": "and could he reflect on that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:59.630",
    "end": "00:05:01.765",
    "start_seconds": 299.63,
    "end_seconds": 301.765,
    "text": "He said,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:01.799",
    "end": "00:05:05.636",
    "start_seconds": 301.799,
    "end_seconds": 305.636,
    "text": "\"I put people in prison cells who are better people than me.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:07.538",
    "end": "00:05:08.739",
    "start_seconds": 307.538,
    "end_seconds": 308.739,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:09.073",
    "end": "00:05:11.642",
    "start_seconds": 309.073,
    "end_seconds": 311.642,
    "text": "Sure enough, he went right back to his talking points,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:11.642",
    "end": "00:05:13.844",
    "start_seconds": 311.642,
    "end_seconds": 313.844,
    "text": "but it didn’t matter, because in that moment --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:13.844",
    "end": "00:05:15.179",
    "start_seconds": 313.844,
    "end_seconds": 315.179,
    "text": "that sliver of his story --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:15.179",
    "end": "00:05:19.583",
    "start_seconds": 315.179,
    "end_seconds": 319.58299999999997,
    "text": "his defenses dropped, and he shifted from being right to being real."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:20.784",
    "end": "00:05:23.420",
    "start_seconds": 320.784,
    "end_seconds": 323.42,
    "text": "Look, some people are just difficult,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:23.454",
    "end": "00:05:25.589",
    "start_seconds": 323.454,
    "end_seconds": 325.589,
    "text": "but we can deal with them more simply."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:25.622",
    "end": "00:05:27.524",
    "start_seconds": 325.622,
    "end_seconds": 327.524,
    "text": "Here are three tips to get you started."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:27.524",
    "end": "00:05:29.827",
    "start_seconds": 327.524,
    "end_seconds": 329.827,
    "text": "First, get the story,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:29.860",
    "end": "00:05:33.797",
    "start_seconds": 329.86,
    "end_seconds": 333.797,
    "text": "particularly the key decisions and the turning points."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:33.831",
    "end": "00:05:38.469",
    "start_seconds": 333.831,
    "end_seconds": 338.469,
    "text": "What someone believes is not as important as how they chose to believe it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:38.836",
    "end": "00:05:41.305",
    "start_seconds": 338.836,
    "end_seconds": 341.305,
    "text": "Second, my NPR host pro tip:"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:41.338",
    "end": "00:05:43.574",
    "start_seconds": 341.338,
    "end_seconds": 343.574,
    "text": "keep your questions short."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:43.607",
    "end": "00:05:45.709",
    "start_seconds": 343.60699999999997,
    "end_seconds": 345.709,
    "text": "10 seconds tops."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:45.743",
    "end": "00:05:49.646",
    "start_seconds": 345.743,
    "end_seconds": 349.646,
    "text": "Long questions can feel like a setup or like you're rambling."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:49.646",
    "end": "00:05:52.416",
    "start_seconds": 349.646,
    "end_seconds": 352.416,
    "text": "And third, use that mental microscope."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:52.449",
    "end": "00:05:54.284",
    "start_seconds": 352.449,
    "end_seconds": 354.284,
    "text": "Look as closely as you can."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:54.318",
    "end": "00:05:57.888",
    "start_seconds": 354.318,
    "end_seconds": 357.888,
    "text": "Remember, you don't have to like it, but learn from it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:58.756",
    "end": "00:06:01.225",
    "start_seconds": 358.756,
    "end_seconds": 361.225,
    "text": "It is time to reconnect,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:01.225",
    "end": "00:06:03.026",
    "start_seconds": 361.225,
    "end_seconds": 363.026,
    "text": "even to the people you can't stand."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:03.060",
    "end": "00:06:06.230",
    "start_seconds": 363.06,
    "end_seconds": 366.23,
    "text": "But this time, we're going to make those connections count."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:06.997",
    "end": "00:06:08.899",
    "start_seconds": 366.997,
    "end_seconds": 368.899,
    "text": "You could learn a lot from an idiot."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:08.899",
    "end": "00:06:09.900",
    "start_seconds": 368.899,
    "end_seconds": 369.9,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:09.933",
    "end": "00:06:13.904",
    "start_seconds": 369.933,
    "end_seconds": 373.904,
    "text": "Especially if you resolve never to act like one."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:14.938",
    "end": "00:06:17.775",
    "start_seconds": 374.938,
    "end_seconds": 377.775,
    "text": "I really appreciate you all making time for me today."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:17.775",
    "end": "00:06:19.009",
    "start_seconds": 377.775,
    "end_seconds": 379.009,
    "text": "Thank you for listening."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:19.042",
    "end": "00:06:21.245",
    "start_seconds": 379.04200000000003,
    "end_seconds": 381.245,
    "text": "(Cheers and applause)"
  }
]
